WEBVTT

00:06:57.704 --> 00:07:00.663
the architectural and design professionals
are providing and working

00:07:00.663 --> 00:07:02.329
on a crucial human right.

00:07:07.413 --> 00:07:12.704
About the ability to live in a life of
dignity and a place that protects you.

00:07:13.746 --> 00:07:18.788
Drugs won't work, the full scope
of your ability to live

00:07:18.788 --> 00:07:20.538
a fruitful life is restricted.

00:07:21.204 --> 00:07:23.829
Did the plan come together then
that you would join him

00:07:23.829 --> 00:07:26.163
and help his mission through architecture
?

00:07:26.579 --> 00:07:31.079
Yeah. So that started a long journey to
work with Dr. Farmer and his team in